T {[S] start-up} 125 -1090 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {[C] Oguey-Aebischer core} 375 -1090 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {d2s_bias_oa_pd: self-contained bias without resistor or BJT (Oguey-Aebischer core + mirror tree of d2s_bias_in), digital enable en_3v3} 60 -1290 0 0 0.5 0.5 {}
T {core current I0 = 0.25 uA (P0 branch); M11 8 I0, MCS 2 I0; I_ref = 20 I0 = 5 uA into NI (through TGN / TGP)} 60 -1240 0 0 0.3 0.3 {}
T {oa_core (Oguey-Aebischer, JSSC 32(7) 1997): no resistor, no BJT.} 60 -20 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {   M11 (8 I0) and M10 (2 x M11 size, I0) share their gate vnc and run in weak inversion, so vres = U_T ln 16 = 72 mV.} 60 4 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {   MCS (diode, 2 I0) and MCL (triode, I0) share gate vbr and size; MCL drops vres only at one inversion level, so} 60 28 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {   I0 = const * 2 n mu Cox U_T^2 (W/L)_C, independent of V_T. I0 = 0.25 uA; PO / POC deliver 20 I0 = 5 uA into NI.} 60 52 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {   MC10 cascodes M10; P0 / P0C are stacked diodes, so every mirror output copies P0's V_DS (line sensitivity).} 60 76 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {   Temperature: I0 ~ mu T^2, about -35 % at -40 C and +33 % at 125 C.} 60 100 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {Mirror tree and diodes. The six diodes are those of d2s_bias_lp and set the bias voltages:} 60 124 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {   vbp: BP 5u/6u, 5 uA (unit tails).  vbpc: BPC 1u/4u, 2 uA (mirror cascodes).  vabp: RP2 on RP1, 5 uA (ABP, FPL).} 60 148 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {   vbn: BN 6u/6u, 5 uA (fold sinks).  vbnc: BNC 1u/8u, 2 uA (fold cascodes).  vabn: RN2 on RN1, 5 uA (ABN, FNL).} 60 172 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {PMOS gate lines come from PMOS diodes on vdd, NMOS gate lines from NMOS diodes on vss: bias crosses blocks as currents.} 60 196 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {RP1 and RN1 are the class-AB replicas of OP and ON: they sit on the output-stage rails vddo / vsso (separate rails} 60 220 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {   from the right). RP2 keeps its n-well on vdd, like ABP. RN1 needs a local substrate tap ring on vsso, like ON.} 60 244 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {[R] output, I_ref} 885 -1090 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {[8] PMOS diodes, NMOS sinks} 1445 -1090 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {[8] vabp} 1285 -1090 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {[8] PMOS sources, NMOS diodes} 1925 -1090 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
T {[8] vabn} 1765 -1090 0 0 0.3 0.3 {layer=10}
